  "Aegis of Life Quest": {
    "source": {
      "url": "https://eqlwiki.com/Aegis_of_Life_Quest",
      "snapshotAt": "2026-08-22T19:51:37.602Z",
      "cachePageId": 15146,
      "cacheSha256": "1e3561b2bb56f851775df69a682d6f62d1be1e9192a1845cb14958c73ebb1923"
    },
    "notes": [
      "The source lists minimum level 35+. Lord Grimrot's live and undead versions are listed at levels 35 and 29 respectively.",
      "The walkthrough requires Warmly faction with Camlend Serbold before the turn-in and warns that insufficient faction can lose the items. Verify his quest dialogue before handing them over.",
      "The walkthrough describes two Pestilence Scythes and specifies the effect-bearing version. A same-name inventory match cannot confirm the correct version.",
      "Capt Linarius starts the quest; Camlend Serbold receives the items and grants the reward.",
      "The bundled source is historical reference. This guide does not infer spawn timers, faction standing, or completion from possession alone."
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "speak-linarius",
        "kind": "pickup",
        "text": "Speak to Capt Linarius on the bridge in Northern Karana about local dangers and Lord Grimrot.",
